      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA HACHI BU (7) finished fourth last time at this track but could not have been more impressive before that in her superb 22.40 win at Geelong over 400m. Looks the one to beat on win two back. CANYA KICK IT (8) continues to race in super honest form hitting the frame at all 10 career runs, winning two back before finishing second last time (16.59) over 300m at Healesville. Has never been out of the money in four starts this course. Has a good overall strike-rate and can find the frame here. HE'S A COLLINDA (2) boxed on well to finish third last time, beaten 1.3 lengths (23.08) behind Doongalla Al at Warragul. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Hard to beat again. PAW ALLESANDRA (1) generally performs well over this distance.",
